# Terraform working directories
**/.terraform/
crash.log
crash.*.log

# SECRETS — state and tfvars contain API credentials, tokens, passwords
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfvars

# Client folders are per-tenant and contain secrets — only the template ships
clients/*
!clients/_TEMPLATE/
!clients/README.md

# Vendor installers (large binaries, licensed)
packages/*.pkg
packages/*.dmg

# Rollout runner artifacts
**/.tfplan-rollout
**/.rollout-plan.log
.DS_Store
